Hook: GET {GATEWAY_API_URL}/chat/search (I5) with the session token; 300 ms debounce; ≥ 3 characters; a newer query aborts the one in flight and an older answer is dropped; dates (yyyy-mm-dd) become the day's start / end; loadMore follows next_cursor (short pages are expected) and skips duplicates.
Global (inbox header, mobile and desktop): results from every DM and group with the conversation's name, snippet (query highlighted) and time; ↑/↓ + Enter or a click opens /inbox/u|g/<id>/msg/<messageId>.
In a conversation (DM header, group header): scope dm:<peer> / group:<id>; choosing a hit, or older / newer, jumps to it in place (I8 loads the window when it is not loaded); a deep link to a message outside the loaded page now also loads its window (DM and group).
Filters: attachment type (any / photos / videos / files / voice / links) and a from–to date range (the member's local days). No sender filter in the UI (the hook supports it).
Not done here: a staging spec and screenshots (owner's check on staging).
